        library ipaddress module (3.3+) provides IPNetwork, IPAddress (IPv4Address/IPv6Address), and 
        AddressValueError/NetmaskValueError equivalents. EUI (MAC address) support would require netaddr or a separate library like 
        macaddress. ipaddress is a viable drop-in for the IP network/address operations which constitute the majority of usage.

